OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785336505
OL,3,CGlen Hansard, Oscar-winning Irish
OL,4,Cmusician, dies in motorcycle crash in
OL,5,CDublin
OL,7,FOscar-winning Irish musician and
OL,8,Factivist Glen Hansard has died after a
OL,9,Fmotorcycle crash in Dublin in the
OL,10,Fearly hours of Wednesday.
OL,12,FThe family of singer Glen Hansard said
OL,13,Fthey are "deeply shocked and
OL,14,Fheartbroken" by his death, his
OL,15,Fmanagement told Ireland's national
OL,16,Fbroadcaster RTE.
