OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785336505
OL,3,CGlen Hansard, Oscar-winning Irish
OL,4,Cmusician, dies in motorcycle crash in
OL,5,CDublin
OL,7,FHansard, 56, was the frontman of Irish
OL,8,Fband The Frames, appeared in the Irish
OL,9,Ffilm The Commitments, and won an
OL,10,FAcademy Award for Best Original Song
OL,11,Fin 2007 for Falling Slowly, which he
OL,12,Fco-wrote with Marketa Irglova for the
OL,13,Ffilm Once.
OL,15,FHe was one half of the rock duo The
OL,16,FSwell Season and released several solo
OL,17,Falbums, including Didn't He Ramble,
OL,18,Fwhich was nominated for a Grammy Award
OL,19,Ffor Best Folk Album in 2016.
OL,26,@tD@SrrtD@]rp
