OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785336505
OL,3,CGlen Hansard, Oscar-winning Irish
OL,4,Cmusician, dies in motorcycle crash in
OL,5,CDublin
OL,7,FFor years, he led the annual Christmas
OL,8,FEve charity busk outside Dublin's
OL,9,FGaiety Theatre, where well-known Irish
OL,10,Fmusicians performed in aid of the
OL,11,FDublin Simon Community.
OL,13,FHe also took part in protests over
OL,14,FIreland's housing crisis, a march
OL,15,Fmarking three years since Russia's
OL,16,Finvasion of Ukraine, and the anti-
OL,17,Fausterity water charges demonstrations
OL,18,Fin 2014.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/7
