OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785336505
OL,3,CGlen Hansard, Oscar-winning Irish
OL,4,Cmusician, dies in motorcycle crash in
OL,5,CDublin
OL,7,FAt the funeral of The Pogues frontman
OL,8,FShane MacGowan in 2023, Hansard
OL,9,Fperformed Fairytale of New York with
OL,10,FIrish singer Lisa O'Neill, prompting
OL,11,Fmourners to dance in the aisles of a
OL,12,Fchurch in Co Tipperary.
OL,14,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,15,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,16,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,17,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,19,FHe is survived by his three-year-old
OL,20,Fson, Christy.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G4/7
