OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785336505
OL,3,CGlen Hansard, Oscar-winning Irish
OL,4,Cmusician, dies in motorcycle crash in
OL,5,CDublin
OL,7,FIrish police said a man in his 50s
OL,8,Fdied in a single-vehicle motorcycle
OL,9,Fcrash in Lucan, on the outskirts of
OL,10,FDublin, shortly before 4.30am on
OL,11,FWednesday.
OL,13,FThe man, who was not named by police,
OL,14,Fwas treated at the scene but was
OL,15,Fpronounced dead a short time later.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/7
