PN,30806
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785336505
OL,3,CGlen Hansard, Oscar-winning Irish
OL,4,Cmusician, dies in motorcycle crash in
OL,5,CDublin
OL,7,FIn a statement to broadcaster RTE, his
OL,8,Fagents ATC management said: "With
OL,9,Fbroken hearts we announce the passing
OL,10,Fof Glen Hansard who passed away, in
OL,11,Fthe early hours of this morning,
OL,12,Ffollowing a road traffic accident in
OL,13,FDublin.
OL,15,F"Glen's family is deeply shocked and
OL,16,Fheartbroken by this tragic loss and
OL,17,Frespectfully requests privacy at this
OL,18,Fextremely difficult time.
OL,26,@oD@arbpD@]OUwD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/7
