OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F308A1785336505
OL,3,CGlen Hansard, Oscar-winning Irish
OL,4,Cmusician, dies in motorcycle crash in
OL,5,CDublin
OL,7,F"The family is grateful for the
OL,8,Fsupport they have received and wishes
OL,9,Fto thank the emergency services who
OL,10,Fattended the scene.
OL,12,F"As this matter remains the subject of
OL,13,Fan active Garda investigation, no
OL,14,Ffurther comment will be made at this
OL,15,Ftime."
